{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026e2F7X5aC6r1795320911.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>選管會主席陸啟康到灣仔會展，巡視選舉中央指揮中心後表示，選舉至今運作暢順，呼籲選民踴躍投票。</p><p></p><p>選管會主席陸啟康說：「我們有信心，今天的選舉在公開、誠實及公平情況下進行。同時投票、點票工作能夠暢順，在合理時間內，完成點票及宣布結果。為方便投票人，選舉事務處已經在各投票站，設置足夠發票櫃枱及投票間，供投票人使用。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:43:12.877345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T03:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:19:52.466357+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:36:36.975531+00:00","content_hash":"ee02993398aca994a7d5a9e8f087c360afbe99352a435242990a44fa80c1baa3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:43:12.877345+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}